{"seq":2,"slug":"differential-flamegraph-regression","title":"差异火焰图与性能回归定位","url":"/l-doc-books/h/performance-engineering/continuous-profiling-flamegraph-performance-engineering/flamegraph-analysis-diff-workflow/differential-flamegraph-regression","wordCount":2635,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"差异火焰图与性能回归定位\">差异火焰图与性能回归定位</h1><p>火焰图回答的是「程序把时间花在哪」，而工程上真正要回答的是另一句话：「这次发布之后，<strong>多花的那部分</strong>时间花在哪」。单张火焰图做不到这件事——它只有当前状态，没有参照。差异火焰图（differential flamegraph）把两份剖面放在同一张图上做有符号比较，颜色承载增量方向，宽度承载变化量级，把「回归」从一个模糊的感受变成可以指到具体栈帧的坐标。本文讨论这套比较机制的量纲约定、三种主流视图的差异语义，以及把它接进发布流水线后如何压制误报。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>差异火焰图的本质是<strong>在栈结构上做逐节点的有符号减法</strong>。给定基线剖面 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span>（例如上一版发布）与候选剖面 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span>（当前版本），对同一条栈路径 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span> 上的样本权重求和，得到带符号差值：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>B</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>A</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta(s) = w_B(s) - w_A(s)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>一张差异图同时编码两件事：<strong>方向</strong>由颜色承载（正增量与负增量两种色调），<strong>量级</strong>由宽度承载。但不同工具对「宽度代表什么」的定义并不一致——这正是最容易读错的地方，后文会专门拆解。</p>\n<p>比较成立有一个前提：两份剖面必须<strong>同类型、同量纲</strong>。pprof 的文档明确指出「pprof can subtract one profile from another, provided the profiles are of compatible types」（<a href=\"https://github.com/google/pprof/blob/main/doc/README.md\">google/pprof doc/README.md</a>）。CPU 剖面只能和 CPU 剖面比，<code>samples</code> 列不能直接和 <code>alloc_space</code> 列相减。第二层前提是<strong>总量可比</strong>：如果候选版本采样了 90 秒、基线只采了 30 秒，绝对样本数天然放大三倍，不归一化就会得到「全线飘红」的假回归。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[基线剖面 A&lt;br/&gt;上一版 / 上一时间窗] --&gt; C[折叠为栈计数]&#10;  B[候选剖面 B&lt;br/&gt;当前版 / 当前时间窗] --&gt; C&#10;  C --&gt; D{总量是否一致}&#10;  D --&gt;|不一致| E[按总量缩放归一化]&#10;  D --&gt;|一致| F[逐栈有符号相减]&#10;  E --&gt; F&#10;  F --&gt; G[双列折叠文件&lt;br/&gt;stack countA countB]&#10;  G --&gt; H[渲染宽度取一列&lt;br/&gt;颜色 = 增量方向]&#10;  H --&gt; I[筛出净增量最大的子树]&#10;  I --&gt; J[回到代码定位根因]\">graph TD\n  A[基线剖面 A&lt;br/&gt;上一版 / 上一时间窗] --&gt; C[折叠为栈计数]\n  B[候选剖面 B&lt;br/&gt;当前版 / 当前时间窗] --&gt; C\n  C --&gt; D{总量是否一致}\n  D --&gt;|不一致| E[按总量缩放归一化]\n  D --&gt;|一致| F[逐栈有符号相减]\n  E --&gt; F\n  F --&gt; G[双列折叠文件&lt;br/&gt;stack countA countB]\n  G --&gt; H[渲染宽度取一列&lt;br/&gt;颜色 = 增量方向]\n  H --&gt; I[筛出净增量最大的子树]\n  I --&gt; J[回到代码定位根因]</pre><h2 id=\"归一化-差异的量纲约定\">归一化：差异的量纲约定</h2><p>先解决归一化，否则后面的读数全部失真。Brendan Gregg 的 <code>difffolded.pl</code> 提供了最直白的做法：当两份折叠文件的总样本数不同时，把第一份的每个计数按比例重写为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>c</mi><mn>1</mn><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">⌊</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>×</mo><mfrac><msub><mtext>total</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mtext>total</mtext><mn>1</mn></msub></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">⌋</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_1&#x27; = \\left\\lfloor c_1 \\times \\frac{\\text{total}_2}{\\text{total}_1} \\right\\rfloor</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0489em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8019em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">⌊</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">total</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">total</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">⌋</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>即 <code>int(count1 * total2 / total1)</code>。其用法是 <code>./difffolded.pl [-hns] folded1 folded2 | ./flamegraph.pl</code>，其中 <code>-n</code> 开启归一化、<code>-s</code> 把十六进制地址重写为统一的 <code>0x...</code> 形式后再比较（<a href=\"https://github.com/brendangregg/FlameGraph\">brendangregg/FlameGraph</a>）。输出是每行三列：栈、来自 folded1 的计数、来自 folded2 的计数；某一侧缺失的栈补零。</p>\n<p>pprof 侧对应的是 <code>-normalize</code>：它在相减之前把源剖面重新缩放，使其样本总量与基线一致，从而比较「相对分布」而不是「绝对总量」（<a href=\"https://github.com/google/pprof/blob/main/doc/README.md\">google/pprof</a>）。</p>\n<p>归一化是有代价的，必须知道自己在做什么：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>是否该归一化</th>\n<th>原因</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>两个时间窗长度不同（30s vs 90s）</td>\n<td><strong>必须</strong></td>\n<td>否则总样本差异被误读为全面回归</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>流量本身涨了 3 倍</td>\n<td>视命题而定</td>\n<td>比「占比」要归一化；比「总 CPU 成本」绝不能归一化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>同一程序累积型剖面（Go block profile）</td>\n<td>用 <code>-base</code>，通常不需要</td>\n<td><code>-base</code> 面向同程序不同时刻的累积剖面，值一般保持为正</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>只看单函数占比变化</td>\n<td>归一化后更稳</td>\n<td>消除规模效应，凸显分布迁移</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>pprof 的 <code>-base</code> 与 <code>-diff_base</code> 的<strong>百分比基准也不同</strong>：<code>-diff_base</code> 输出里的百分比相对于基线剖面的样本总量；而 <code>-base</code> 在一般情形下，百分比基于地址级聚合后的<strong>样本绝对值总量</strong>（<a href=\"https://github.com/google/pprof/blob/main/doc/README.md\">google/pprof</a>）。选错基准会让「占比 12%」在两种模式下指向完全不同的分母——写报告引用百分比时，必须写明用的是哪个标志。</p>\n<h2 id=\"三种差异视图的差异语义\">三种差异视图的差异语义</h2><p>同一个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span>，不同工具选择让观众先看到不同的东西。读差异图之前先确认「宽度代表什么」，否则会得出相反的结论。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>宽度含义</th>\n<th>颜色含义</th>\n<th>关键开关</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>pprof Web UI</td>\n<td>子树内增量的<strong>绝对值之和</strong>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∑</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">∣</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">∣</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum\\lvert\\Delta\\rvert</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mopen\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mclose\">∣</span></span></span></span></span>）</td>\n<td>阴影：净增为红、净减为绿</td>\n<td><code>--diff_base</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>FlameGraph <code>difffolded.pl</code></td>\n<td>第二份文件决定宽度</td>\n<td>增量为红、减量为蓝</td>\n<td><code>-n</code> 归一化、<code>--negate</code> 反转色调、<code>--cp</code> 保持配色</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>speedscope 单剖面视图</td>\n<td>按权重排序的栈</td>\n<td>无差异语义</td>\n<td>视图 <code>1</code> 时间序 / <code>2</code> 左重 / <code>3</code> 三明治</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>pprof Web UI 的语义最反直觉，也最有信息量。文档写明「box width is proportional to the sum of the increases and decreases in the sub-tree rooted at box」——宽度是子树里增与减<strong>相加</strong>的幅度，而阴影区域才是净变化。文档的例子很清楚：一个子节点减少 150、另一个增加 200，父节点框体现 350 的总变动，阴影只画 50 的净增（<a href=\"https://github.com/google/pprof/blob/main/doc/README.md\">google/pprof</a>）。所以<strong>宽框不一定代表变慢了</strong>——它可能只是内部发生了剧烈的此消彼长。找回归要顺着<strong>阴影</strong>走，而非顺着宽框走。</p>\n<p>FlameGraph 的语义依赖于比较顺序。<code>difffolded.pl folded1 folded2</code> 的输出里，<strong>第二份文件决定帧宽</strong>，红表示增加、蓝表示减少；想反过来以第一份文件为宽并反转颜色，用 <code>./difffolded.pl folded2 folded1 | ./flamegraph.pl --negate</code>（<a href=\"https://github.com/brendangregg/FlameGraph\">brendangregg/FlameGraph</a>）。做发布回归时通常把基线放 <code>folded1</code>、候选放 <code>folded2</code>，于是宽度是「现在长什么样」，颜色是「比之前多了还是少了」。<code>--cp</code>（consistent palette）解决跨图对比的记忆负担：首次渲染生成 <code>palette.map</code>，后续图复用函数到颜色的映射。</p>\n<p>speedscope 的说明文档只描述了三种单剖面视图（<code>1</code> Time Order、<code>2</code> Left Heavy、<code>3</code> Sandwich）以及 <code>n</code>/<code>p</code> 在剖面与线程间切换（<a href=\"https://github.com/jlfwong/speedscope\">jlfwong/speedscope</a>）；差异比较需在折叠文件层面先完成。这提示一条通用原则：<strong>差异是一步数据运算，视图只是它的一个渲染目标</strong>。Polar Signals 亦把「时间是火焰图缺失的维度」单列成题（<a href=\"https://www.polarsignals.com/blog\">polarsignals.com/blog</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"从差异图到回归定因的工作流\">从差异图到回归定因的工作流</h2><p>差异图给出的是「哪里变了」，定因还需要把「变了」翻译成「为什么」。下面这条链路把比较、显著性判定、代码归因串起来。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[确认回归可复现&lt;br/&gt;不是单次抖动] --&gt; B[取同量纲基线&lt;br/&gt;同负载 / 同窗口 / 同机型]&#10;  B --&gt; C[归一化后有符号相减]&#10;  C --&gt; D[按净增量排序子树]&#10;  D --&gt; E{新增帧 还是 既有帧变重}&#10;  E --&gt;|新增帧| F[新代码路径或新依赖&lt;br/&gt;查该发布 diff]&#10;  E --&gt;|既有帧变重| G[展开 callee 看自耗时&lt;br/&gt;区分 self 与 total]&#10;  G --&gt; H[回到源码 / 配置 / 数据量]&#10;  H --&gt; I[修复后重采验证 Δ 归零]\">graph TD\n  A[确认回归可复现&lt;br/&gt;不是单次抖动] --&gt; B[取同量纲基线&lt;br/&gt;同负载 / 同窗口 / 同机型]\n  B --&gt; C[归一化后有符号相减]\n  C --&gt; D[按净增量排序子树]\n  D --&gt; E{新增帧 还是 既有帧变重}\n  E --&gt;|新增帧| F[新代码路径或新依赖&lt;br/&gt;查该发布 diff]\n  E --&gt;|既有帧变重| G[展开 callee 看自耗时&lt;br/&gt;区分 self 与 total]\n  G --&gt; H[回到源码 / 配置 / 数据量]\n  H --&gt; I[修复后重采验证 Δ 归零]</pre><p>第一步必须先<strong>确认回归是真的</strong>。采样是统计过程，占比 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 的函数在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 个样本下的相对误差量级约为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msqrt><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/\\sqrt{r \\cdot n}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0572em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8072em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:0.833em;\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.7672em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2328em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>——这决定了小样本差异天然噪声大，低频帧的「涨幅」大多不可信（推导见同章 <a href=\"../profiling-signal-sampling-model/statistical-bias-significance-model\">统计偏差与显著性模型</a>）。实操上先看<strong>绝对净增量</strong>排前列、且占比足够高的帧，再对可疑帧用独立窗口复采确认。</p>\n<p>第二步是<strong>区分新增帧与既有帧变重</strong>。新增帧几乎总指向该发布引入的新代码路径、新依赖或新配置开关；既有帧变重则要区分两种成因：调用它的上游变多了（total 涨、self 平），还是它自己每单位调用变慢了（self 涨）。这直接对应差异图上的两种形态——前者表现为某父节点整棵子树一起变红，后者表现为单个叶子帧独立变红。</p>\n<p>第三步是<strong>把差异锚定到发布边界</strong>。持续剖析的价值在于它天然是时间序列：把基线窗口卡在上线前、候选窗口卡在上线后、负载与机型保持一致，差异图就从「两个快照的对比」变成「一次发布的因果证据」。若两次采集之间工具链变了（例如编译器版本升级导致内联决策改变），栈的形状本身会变，出现大量<strong>伪差异帧</strong>——此时应先修符号化管道再谈性能，见 <a href=\"../collector-symbolization-ebpf/collector-architecture-pprof-format\">采集器架构与 pprof / OTel Profiles 数据格式</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"显著性判据与误报抑制\">显著性判据与误报抑制</h2><p>把差异图接进流水线当门禁，误报成本极高：假回归会阻塞发布，几次之后团队就不再看这张图。抑制误报依赖三条可量化的判据。</p>\n<p><strong>判据一：样本量下界。</strong> 对占比 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 的帧，要分辨相对变化 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span></span>，需要的样本量大致满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>≳</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mi>δ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n \\gtrsim \\frac{1}{r \\cdot \\delta^2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9592em;vertical-align:-0.2296em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel amsrm\">≳</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0074em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7401em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>例如某帧占 1%、想可靠识别 20% 的相对回归，就需要约 2500 个样本——100Hz 采样下约 25 秒该负载的有效 CPU 时间。低于此量级的差异一律不作为门禁依据。</p>\n<p><strong>判据二：净增量阈值 + 占比阈值双门。</strong> 只卡净增量会漏掉分母很小的帧，只卡占比会漏掉总量极大的绝对成本。两个条件同时满足才告警。</p>\n<p><strong>判据三：跨窗口稳定性。</strong> 同一候选版本连采多个窗口，差异方向一致才算回归；单窗口的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span> 只能算「疑似」。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>误报来源</th>\n<th>表现</th>\n<th>抑制手段</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>采样统计噪声</td>\n<td>低频帧随机涨跌</td>\n<td>样本量下界 + 跨窗口一致性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>总量未归一化</td>\n<td>全线飘红</td>\n<td><code>-n</code> / <code>-normalize</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>负载或机型漂移</td>\n<td>多个无关子树同向变化</td>\n<td>固定负载与机型，或按 label 分层比较</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>符号化漂移</td>\n<td>大量帧名变化、出现未知符号</td>\n<td>采集前后校验 build-id 与符号服务</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>编译器内联决策变化</td>\n<td>同一逻辑栈被拆/合</td>\n<td>核对工具链版本，必要时按语义合并栈</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>持续剖析平台通常带 label（服务、区域、实例、版本），按版本维度做差异能自动剥离机型与负载漂移——这也是 OpenTelemetry Profiles 信号虽然仍处于 <strong>Alpha</strong> 阶段（<a href=\"https://opentelemetry.io/docs/specs/otel/profiles/\">opentelemetry.io</a>），但其「剖面带标签、可与 trace/metrics 关联」的方向对差异分析格外有价值的原因：只有带着版本标签，差异图才真正绑定到发布事件上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>差异火焰图 = 栈结构上的<strong>有符号减法</strong>，方向由颜色承载，量级由宽度承载；先确认宽度定义再读数。</li>\n<li>pprof Web UI 的<strong>宽度是子树增量的绝对值之和</strong>，阴影才是净变化——找回归要顺阴影走，不要顺宽框走。</li>\n<li><strong>归一化是前提不是可选</strong>：<code>difffolded.pl -n</code> 用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mtext>total</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mtext>total</mtext><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_1 \\times \\text{total}_2 / \\text{total}_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">total</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">total</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 对齐总量，pprof 用 <code>-normalize</code>；但比总成本时绝不归一化。</li>\n<li><code>-diff_base</code> 与 <code>-base</code> 的<strong>百分比基准不同</strong>，引用百分比必须写明所用标志。</li>\n<li>定因链路：<strong>确认可复现 → 同量纲基线 → 归一化相减 → 按净增量排序 → 区分新增帧与既有帧变重 → 区分 self 与 total → 锚定发布边界</strong>。</li>\n<li>门禁化压误报的三条件：样本量下界 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>≳</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>r</mi><msup><mi>δ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n \\gtrsim 1/(r\\delta^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9592em;vertical-align:-0.2296em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel amsrm\">≳</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>、净增量与占比双阈值、跨窗口方向一致。</li>\n<li>用 label（版本、区域、实例）做分层差异，能把「归因于发布」与「归因于环境」分开——这是持续剖析相对一次性快照的核心优势。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"差异火焰图与性能回归定位","id":"差异火焰图与性能回归定位"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"归一化：差异的量纲约定","id":"归一化-差异的量纲约定"},{"level":2,"text":"三种差异视图的差异语义","id":"三种差异视图的差异语义"},{"level":2,"text":"从差异图到回归定因的工作流","id":"从差异图到回归定因的工作流"},{"level":2,"text":"显著性判据与误报抑制","id":"显著性判据与误报抑制"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"火焰图类型族与读图方法论","url":"/l-doc-books/h/performance-engineering/continuous-profiling-flamegraph-performance-engineering/flamegraph-analysis-diff-workflow/flamegraph-types-reading-method"},"next":{"title":"多语言混合栈、off-CPU 与疑难根因实战","url":"/l-doc-books/h/performance-engineering/continuous-profiling-flamegraph-performance-engineering/flamegraph-analysis-diff-workflow/mixed-language-offcpu-root-cause"}}